 lverman\n- Adam Shapiro\n- Fern Grandin\n\n\n(synopsis non encore traduit 
 sur TMDB)\nWhen Alzheimer's disease begins to strip away her mother's vibr
 ant personality\, a headstrong young woman is forced to return to her oddb
