 re for her. She quickly realizes she must accept the cruel and warped real
 ity of the disease\, and the imperfect beauty of her family\, in order to 
 become the daughter they need.\n\n\nFiche TMDB : https://www.themoviedb.or
 g/movie/1316999\n\nDonnées fournies par The Movie Database (TMDB).\nCe pr
 oduit utilise l'API TMDB mais n'est ni approuvé ni certifié par TMDB.
